prompt_messages.content:
GOAL:
{'id': 'plat-09-artifact-signing', 'description': 'Roll out artifact signing and SBOM across all build pipelines. Must: integrate Cosign for container image signing, generate SBOM with Syft for every build, store signatures in Rekor transparency log, configure Kyverno policy to reject unsigned images in production clusters, verify all deployed images have valid signatures, and set up key rotation procedure. Risk factors: signing key compromise, Kyverno policy too strict blocking deploys, SBOM generation adding build time, key rotation breaking signature verification. Tools available: Cosign, Syft, Rekor, Kyverno, GitHub Actions.', 'constraints': {'budget': {'max_tokens': None, 'max_calls': None, 'max_revisions': None}, 'time': None, 'environment': 'production', 'tools': ['Cosign', 'Syft', 'Rekor', 'Kyverno']}, 'risk_tolerance': 'balanced', 'replan_policy': 'patch', 'approval_ttl': None, 'metadata': {}}

Produce the PlanVersion JSON now. version=1.

prompt_full_text:
--- system ---
/no_think You are a planner. Reply with ONLY a JSON object (no markdown, no prose, no thinking). Use EXACTLY these field names: id, goal_id, version, tasks, dependencies, branches. Each task uses: id, description, action, target, risk_class, optional rollback{trigger,action,safety_guard}, optional verification{what,how,expected}, optional preconditions (array of {description, fact, established_by}), optional parallel_group, optional blast_radius. preconditions MUST be objects with description, fact, established_by fields — NEVER strings. established_by MUST be the id of an earlier task in the plan that establishes the fact, or 'env' if it is an environment fact (not a task output). Do NOT use fact names or descriptions as established_by — use the task id. Each dependency uses: from_task, to_task, kind, optional reason. Each branch uses: id, kind (MUST be 'fan_out' or 'fan_in'), tasks (array of task id STRINGS, not objects), join (MUST be 'all', 'any', or 'quorum'). branches is OPTIONAL — omit it if the plan has no fan-out/fan-in structure. Do NOT put rollback or verification inside branches. High/critical risk tasks MUST have rollback AND verification. All tasks with risk_class high or critical MUST include both rollback and verification objects. Example shape: {"id":"plan-x","goal_id":"g","version":1,"tasks":[{"id":"backup","description":"Back up the database","action":"backup","target":"db","risk_class":"medium","preconditions":[{"description":"db is reachable","fact":"db_healthy","established_by":"env"}]},{"id":"migrate","description":"Apply schema migration","action":"migrate","target":"schema","risk_class":"high","rollback":{"trigger":"migration fails","action":"restore from backup","safety_guard":"verify backup integrity"},"verification":{"what":"schema version","how":"run checks","expected":"v2"}}],"dependencies":[{"from_task":"backup","to_task":"migrate","kind":"hard"}]}

--- user ---
GOAL:
{'id': 'plat-09-artifact-signing', 'description': 'Roll out artifact signing and SBOM across all build pipelines. Must: integrate Cosign for container image signing, generate SBOM with Syft for every build, store signatures in Rekor transparency log, configure Kyverno policy to reject unsigned images in production clusters, verify all deployed images have valid signatures, and set up key rotation procedure. Risk factors: signing key compromise, Kyverno policy too strict blocking deploys, SBOM generation adding build time, key rotation breaking signature verification. Tools available: Cosign, Syft, Rekor, Kyverno, GitHub Actions.', 'constraints': {'budget': {'max_tokens': None, 'max_calls': None, 'max_revisions': None}, 'time': None, 'environment': 'production', 'tools': ['Cosign', 'Syft', 'Rekor', 'Kyverno']}, 'risk_tolerance': 'balanced', 'replan_policy': 'patch', 'approval_ttl': None, 'metadata': {}}

Produce the PlanVersion JSON now. version=1.

response_content:
{
  "id": "plat-09-artifact-signing-plan",
  "goal_id": "plat-09-artifact-signing",
  "version": 1,
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "integrate_cosign",
      "description": "Integrate Cosign for container image signing",
      "action": "integrate",
      "target": "Cosign",
      "risk_class": "high",
      "rollback": {
        "trigger": "integration fails",
        "action": "revert to previous signing mechanism",
        "safety_guard": "ensure rollback does not affect ongoing deployments"
      },
      "verification": {
        "what": "Cosign functionality",
        "how": "run integration tests",
        "expected": "signing works without errors"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "generate_sbom",
      "description": "Generate SBOM with Syft for every build",
      "action": "generate",
      "target": "SBOM",
      "risk_class": "medium",
      "preconditions": [
        {
          "description": "Syft is installed",
          "fact": "syft_installed",
          "established_by": "env"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "store_signatures",
      "description": "Store signatures in Rekor transparency log",
      "action": "store",
      "target": "Rekor",
      "risk_class": "high",
      "rollback": {
        "trigger": "storage fails",
        "action": "log error and notify team",
        "safety_guard": "ensure all signatures are retried"
      },
      "verification": {
        "what": "signature storage success",
        "how": "check Rekor log for entries",
        "expected": "entries match signatures"
      },
      "preconditions": [
        {
          "description": "Rekor is reachable",
          "fact": "rekor_healthy",
          "established_by": "env"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "configure_kyverno",
      "description": "Configure Kyverno policy to reject unsigned images in production clusters",
      "action": "configure",
      "target": "Kyverno",
      "risk_class": "critical",
      "rollback": {
        "trigger": "policy causes deploy block",
        "action": "remove policy",
        "safety_guard": "confirm with devs before removal"
      },
      "verification": {
        "what": "policy enforcement",
        "how": "attempt deploy with unsigned image",
        "expected": "deployment fails"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verify_images",
      "description": "Verify all deployed images have valid signatures",
      "action": "verify",
      "target": "images",
      "risk_class": "high",
      "rollback": {
        "trigger": "verification fails",
        "action": "review deployments for unsigned images",
        "safety_guard": "prioritize production environment"
      },
      "verification": {
        "what": "deployment status",
        "how": "audit deployed images",
        "expected": "all images verified"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "set_up_key_rotation",
      "description": "Set up key rotation procedure",
      "action": "set up",
      "target": "key rotation",
      "risk_class": "high",
      "rollback": {
        "trigger": "key rotation issues",
        "action": "revert to old signing key",
        "safety_guard": "validate integrity of old key"
      },
      "verification": {
        "what": "key rotation success",
        "how": "test new key for signing",
        "expected": "new key signs images correctly"
      }
    }
  ],
  "dependencies": [
    {
      "from_task": "integrate_cosign",
      "to_task": "generate_sbom",
      "kind": "hard"
    },
    {
      "from_task": "generate_sbom",
      "to_task": "store_signatures",
      "kind": "hard"
    },
    {
      "from_task": "store_signatures",
      "to_task": "configure_kyverno",
      "kind": "hard"
    },
    {
      "from_task": "configure_kyverno",
      "to_task": "verify_images",
      "kind": "hard"
    },
    {
      "from_task": "verify_images",
      "to_task": "set_up_key_rotation",
      "kind": "hard"
    }
  ]
}
